{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MeloMisterio is a platformer where you overcome obstacles and aim for the goal, but its unique feature is that the sounds of your actions become melodies\u2014and you use those melodies to control mechanics.<br>This creates a new musical experience where you can play an action game and perform music at the same time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying actions where sounds become melodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanics you control with the melodies you perform</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various musical interactions &amp; effects that deepen the experience</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Satisfying actions where sounds become melodies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In MeloMisterio, every action\u2014such as jumping and dashing\u2014has two assigned buttons.<br>One plays a note one step higher than the previous note in the melody, following the scale. The other plays a note one step lower.<br>By combining them, the notes move up and down, creating a melody.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This system makes every input feel satisfying, creating an improvisation-like play experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/d2880e1ca9dfc2f1bcfb3e16a96e7da8.poster.avif?t=1771166162\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/d2880e1ca9dfc2f1bcfb3e16a96e7da8.webm?t=1771166162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/d2880e1ca9dfc2f1bcfb3e16a96e7da8.mp4?t=1771166162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics you control with the melodies you perform</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raising and lowering the melody is not just about making sounds.<br>In some sections, you move mechanics by changing the melody\u2014such as shifting fences and lifts up/down or left/right, or rotating them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform melodies and open the path to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/ea40a71d1262c75c22e27023acca848c.poster.avif?t=1771166162\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/ea40a71d1262c75c22e27023acca848c.webm?t=1771166162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/ea40a71d1262c75c22e27023acca848c.mp4?t=1771166162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/70b8377299a0d2959aae26b536b2a189.poster.avif?t=1771166162\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/70b8377299a0d2959aae26b536b2a189.webm?t=1771166162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/70b8377299a0d2959aae26b536b2a189.mp4?t=1771166162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/715014167a8ea03f157668140049279d.poster.avif?t=1771166162\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/715014167a8ea03f157668140049279d.webm?t=1771166162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/715014167a8ea03f157668140049279d.mp4?t=1771166162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various musical interactions &amp; effects that deepen the experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many other musical interactions and effects beyond melody-controlled mechanics, such as walls that move in rhythm and musical notes that play a counter-melody when collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the music, enjoy the journey, and reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/56d279cf6125e059b1b04b26a63fc91f.poster.avif?t=1771166162\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/56d279cf6125e059b1b04b26a63fc91f.webm?t=1771166162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/56d279cf6125e059b1b04b26a63fc91f.mp4?t=1771166162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/5d1ed7a5fa8e28511bf085578c6491d6.poster.avif?t=1771166162\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/5d1ed7a5fa8e28511bf085578c6491d6.webm?t=1771166162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099880/extras/5d1ed7a5fa8e28511bf085578c6491d6.mp4?t=1771166162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepage